    "see": "✔ every agent has an owner and says what data it sees and whether it runs unattended (0.341292ms)\\n✔ no agent sees PHI (0.078417ms)\\n✖ a planned agent holds no keys in its VM (0.360125ms)\\n✖ a planned agent works in exactly one repo (0.128375ms)\\nℹ pass 2\\nℹ fail 2\\n  AssertionError [ERR_ASSERTION]: cifix has keys: Anthropic key in the VM, to save a network hop\\n  AssertionError [ERR_ASSERTION]: bug-fixer has repos: RhinoHealth/fcp, RhinoHealth/infrastructure"
