  "build": "Write a fifth rule in rules.test.ts: an unattended planned agent writes in Jira only on its own ticket, so its jira line must be none or its own ticket only. Run the tests and see the bug fixer fail it too. Then narrow the two rows until all five tests pass: cifix holds no keys in its VM, and the bug fixer gets one repo and Jira writes on its own ticket only. Finish by asking node who.ts RhinoHealth/infrastructure again.",
