   "Friday before the pilot. The playbook, the document that says what the platform does when something fails, is four weeks old and sounds very sure of itself: a dead VM is replaced from the last checkpoint, a second dead VM stops the run and tells a person, a plan nobody decides gets one reminder and goes back, and Stop always wins. Since it was written, forty pull requests have been merged into the agent runtime, the code that runs our agents. One of them simplified the waiting code.",
