   "The ai-agents account is created in Control Tower with SCPs for us-east-1 only, no leaving the organization, and no VPC peering, Transit Gateway attachments or NAT gateways for anyone but TerraformDeploymentRole, which is bootstrapped by hand. terraform/accounts/ai-agents/ is copied from the solutions account, with a GitHub Actions role that trusts only the infrastructure repo's ai-agents environment. modules/aws-vpc-private is a copy of modules/aws-vpc with no public subnets, internet gateway or NAT, flow logs always on, an S3 gateway endpoint limited to our buckets and interface endpoints with private DNS.",
