   "Two weeks into the pilot, a harder ticket fails its first attempt: after an hour the locked checks are still red. Someone on the team has an idea. Nova, our ticket-to-PR agent, can already start many agents from inside its VM with a dynamic workflow, the script you wrote in the lesson on many agents. Why not start three agents that each try a fix at the same time, and keep the best one?",
