   "A tool that finds unused code is easy to run. Point knip, a tool that lists unused files and exports in a TypeScript project, at our frontend and it prints a long list in a few seconds. Delete everything on the list and the build may still pass, and then a page that loads a widget by name, with a dynamic import that knip cannot follow, breaks in production.",
