  "build": "validate does not check that a skill's name field matches its folder, and a mismatch breaks every reference to the skill. Write scripts/check_skills.py: for every plugins/*/skills/*/SKILL.md, read the frontmatter between the first two --- lines, and fail when name differs from the folder name, or when description plus when_to_use is 600 characters or more (our limit, stricter than Claude Code's 1,536 cut). Print ✔ or ✘ per skill and exit 1 if any failed. Test it: change name: fe-codebase to name: frontend-codebase in the fe-guild skill, confirm claude plugin validate plugins/fe-guild --strict still passes, and confirm your script fails.",
