   "plugin-ci.yml in RhinoHealth/claude-plugins runs on every pull request and push to main, and other repositories that hold plugins (rnd-kb-tooling for kb, fcp-local-lab for fcp-lab) call the same workflow. The validate job installs a pinned Claude Code, runs claude plugin validate --strict on both catalogs and every plugin, then scripts/check_skills.py (name matches folder, description plus when_to_use under 600 characters, an owner in catalog.yaml, 3 to 10 eval cases, a warning on capitalised MUST, NEVER or CRITICAL) and scripts/check_version_bump.py. plugin-ci / validate is required in the ruleset.",
