   "The course follows the plan for our AI-agent platform: one walkthrough part for each of its nine goals, so the parts called G0 to G8 match the goals with the same names. Each of the 242 tickets is taught by exactly one walkthrough lesson, and the foundation lessons teach the tools those tickets use.",
   "This lesson unlocks no ticket by itself. The next lesson follows RH-1234 through the whole platform, and the two after it show the order the plan is built in and the repos the work lands in."
