   "a": "You, Jira, poll, Temporal, Slack; warm pool, VM, broker, GitHub, Byte; gateway, approval. The poisoned comment finds no keys on the VM (and the proxy blocks uploads), the broker refuses the push, the approval check refuses the requester, and Temporal replaces the dead VM."
