  "build": "The SSM agent on the VM needs three interface endpoints: ssm, ssmmessages and ec2messages (the service names are com.amazonaws.us-east-1.<name>). Create all three in the three subnets with private DNS turned on; you can get the subnet IDs with aws ec2 describe-subnets --filters Name=vpc-id,Values=$VPC --query 'Subnets[].SubnetId' --output text. Then write one describe-vpc-endpoints command that prints the type, the service name and the number of network cards of every endpoint in $VPC. Last, read the routes again: did the interface endpoints add any route?",
