   "The orchestrator's acquireSandbox activity claims a VM by raising the desired count, waiting for InService and detaching the VM. On Spot VMs, the image's spot-watch timer writes /run/nova/preempt, the harness checkpoints and exits as preempted, and the workflow retries the step on a fresh VM from the same group."
