   "Monday, 09:25. Nova posts its plan for RH-1234 in the ticket's Slack thread, with three buttons: Approve, Change and Stop. The VM that wrote the plan has already been released. But you left for a long weekend at 09:10, so nobody presses anything until Thursday.",
